<import name="card" source="@/components/landing/card.nijor" />
<body>
    <section class="container">
        <div class="intro">
            <h2>Everything you need to build modern web apps</h2>
            <p>Nijor includes the essential tools to build fast, structured, and scalable web applications without unnecessary complexity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="main">
            <card title="Reusable Components">Build self-contained components with scoped styles and reuse them across your application.</card>
            <card title="File-Based Routing">Define routes through your file structure, with support for layouts and dynamic parameters.</card>
            <card title="Reactivity">Create interactive interfaces with simple reactive variables and predictable updates.</card>
            <card title="SSR">Render on the client or the server, with server-side rendering support that continues to evolve.</card>
            <card title="Server Middleware">Handle authentication, access control, and request processing with server-side middleware.</card>
            <card title="Plugins">Extend Nijor with plugins and add support for custom features and integrations.</card>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>

<style>
    .container{
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3rem;
        padding: 80px 30px;
        background-color: #efefef;
    }

    .intro{
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
    }

    h2{
        font-size: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    p{
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .main{
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(1, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        width: 100%;
    }

    @media only screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        .main{
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
    }
</style>

<style theme="dark">
    .container{
        background-color: #242527;
    }
</style>